<div class="modal fade" id="modalEnrollmentBlocked" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="modalEnrollmentBlockedLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
        <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
            <div class="modal-header bg-warning bg-opacity-10 border-bottom border-warning-subtle">
                <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold text-warning-emphasis d-flex align-items-center gap-2" id="modalEnrollmentBlockedLabel">
                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill fs-4 text-warning"></i>
                    無法預約或登記候補
                </h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="關閉"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-warning bg-warning bg-opacity-10 flex-shrink-0" style="width: 48px; height: 48px;">
                        <i class="bi bi-person-x fs-3"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-dark" id="enrollmentBlockedStudentName">@student?.FullName</h6>
                        <p class="text-secondary small mb-0" id="enrollmentBlockedMessage">
                            該學生本學期尚未完成續報（或已退班），暫無法登記或候補課堂；請洽班主任辦理學期續報。
                        </p>
